  step,dige:46f0d4746b79dccf
  step=2,desc:load Atlas and Lagoon on demand — stand Atlas on the frozen corpus and the reader beside it,dige:8072b19f8378bd2f
  step=3,desc:open the hole — the head is a field to type into and the families stand around it,dige:2080d71d27accc4c
  step=4,desc:type into the hole — one vertebra per file and its ribs the stem families holding hits,dige:9e6bfcb7cea2d930
  step=5,desc:press the file — its methods in file order with a family named once and fused by stem,dige:e98911c16c103352
  step=6,desc:press a method — its code lands and the glass becomes its doors,dige:aebc3d52837f2b04
  step=7,desc:press what it calls — the walk lands in that method and its door back is its caller,dige:4b633bc3ab8ba70c
  step=8,desc:press the head — the rope climbs back one step,dige:0ec97a5cad5bed72
  step=9,dige:b0c46d554deabde7,desc:climb past the surface — the seeker leaves and the cave tells the face
